{"strongs": "H0155", "word": "אַדֶּ֫רֶת", "translit": "ad.de.ret", "root": "אדרת", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "glory, cloak", "definition": "אַדֶּ֫רֶת noun feminine glory, cloak — ׳ א absolute Josh 7:24 אַדָּ֑רֶת Ezek 17:8 construct Gen 25:25 + 4 t.; אַדַּרְתּוֺ 1Kgs 19:13 + 3 t.; אַדַּרתָּם Zech 11:3 — 1. glory, magnificence , of vine Ezek 17:8 (so Thes MV , but < adjective f. from אַדִּיר q. v.), of shepherds Zech 11:3 (or sub 2 ). 2. mantle, cloak (wide garment) of hair שֵׂעָר Gen 25:25 ; Zech 13:4 (as prophetic mantle, so perhaps Zech 11:3 of shepherds = false prophets) compare of Elijah 1Kgs 19:13 ; 1Kgs 19:19 ; 2Kgs 2:8 ; 2Kgs 2:13 ; 2Kgs 2:14 but אַדֶּרֶת שִׁנְעָר טוֺבָה (fine mantle of Shinar = Babylonian mantle — doubtless costly) Josh 7:21 ; Josh 7:24 ( J ) & (late) ׳ א alone Jonah 3:6 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB139')\">BDB139</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H155')\">H155</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB138')\">BDB138</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB140')\">BDB140</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אַדֶּ֫רֶת</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>glory, cloak</highlightword> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Josh 7:24\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,24)\">Josh 7:24</ref> <bdbheb>אַדָּ֑רֶת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,8)\">Ezek 17:8</ref> construct <ref ref=\"Gen 25:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,25)\">Gen 25:25</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>אַדַּרְתּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,13)\">1Kgs 19:13</ref> + 3 t.; <bdbheb>אַדַּרתָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 11:3\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(38,11,3)\">Zech 11:3</ref> — <div class=\"poi